10-23 18:05:40.567 21890 21890 I loops   : ANSWER loop=2 variant=int4 q=recipe first_token_ms=706.7 tok_s=9.70 total_ms=10512.7 chunks=94 thought_chars=0 load_ms=none backend=GPU mark=none text="To find the amount of flour needed for 6 people, you can use a simple proportion:\n\n1.  **Find the amount of flour per person:**\n    $300\\text{ g} \\div 4\\text{ people} = 75\\text{ g per person}$\n\n2.  **Multiply by the number of people:**\n    $75\\text{ g} \\times 6\\text{ people} = 450\\text{ g}$\n\nYou will need **450 g** of flour"
